# v1.2 design development log -- DEVELOPMENT SEEDS ONLY (held-out generator bases 7000000, 8000000, 1;
# benchmark generator base 1). No evaluation seed of any earlier report and no v1.2 held-out seed was run.

## 1. Root cause of v1.1's lost in-catalog identifications (family LEFT IN, B2 correct but B4 not)
# Buckets: UNVERIFIED:signal-set-costs-more-than-cap = the claim's signal experiments cost more than the cap
# (no allocation can verify it); UNVERIFIED:engine-...-exhausted-budget = affordable in principle, but the
# frozen engine's own spend (much of it replicates: decisive replications, repeated prospective tests)
# left too little; CLAIM_INADEQUATE / CATALOG_* = an adequacy test rejected a correct claim (false alarm),
# split into global and localized-only.
