## 3. Known negative results carried into the freeze
# - noise-only benchmark worlds (dev base 1, budget 24): B5 does not endorse 'no effect' in 3/3 worlds
#   that B4 endorsed (one CATALOG_INCOMPLETE after the first-measurement glitch, two ADEQUACY_UNVERIFIED:
#   single classes at their smallest amplitude stay adequate and four rival tests do not exclude them).
# - compositions: the gate-led claim is the simplest adequate hypothesis; composition-00 (budget 12) was
#   answered with one of its two classes (SUPPORTED, WRONG_CLAIM).
# - alpha spending: implemented as Holm over every registered prediction of a mechanism (ledger rule);
#   no separate look-spending for v1.1's localized checks was added -- the root cause shows localized-only
#   false alarms at 1/240 or fewer per budget on development seeds.
